Audio shared by Carly Huitema (University of Guelph): And even at home, parents create family rules to keep children safe and teach responsibility, using chore charts, rewards, or consequences to hold them accountable. Governance, in all these forms, is the process humans use to manage chaos, to create order, trust, and accountability.

338
00:35:22.949 --> 00:35:27.609
Audio shared by Carly Huitema (University of Guelph): It's what allows systems large and small to function fairly and predictably.

339
00:35:27.649 --> 00:35:37.409
